Ops, 11 Oct 11:01Z: 0120's DONE WHEN failed on its first live run.

- openDueCampaigns still timed out at 8 s. 0120 was measured warm, on 25
  targets; the job asks for all 661, and cold, the UserConnection lookup
  behind every target phone is a disk read (EXPLAIN ANALYZE on production,
  130 phones: 4.5 s cold, 0.18 s warm). The phones now go 100 to a statement,
  each on a 20 s limit (the long pool) — a 6-hourly job, nobody waiting.
- queueWarmTieQuestions failed on „operator does not exist: text = integer":
  pending_updates.user_id is TEXT. Compared as u.id::text; the fixed query
  plans on production (EXPLAIN, read-only).

